5 + 520 = 4880mm、耐力壁以外が 3450 + 2×455 + 455 = 4815mm、各27本。横筋は耐力壁が 5200 + 2×455 + 520 = 6630mm、耐力壁以外が 5200 + 2×455 + 455 = 6565mm、各19本。単位質量は D13 を 1.000kg/m とする。耐力壁以外は cover.minimum の雑壁行を使い、lap.wall.minimum を ruleHits に含めない。\\\"\\r\\n  },\\r\\n  \\\"changedFiles\\\": [\\r\\n    \\\"src/domain/model/member.ts\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"src/domain/model/project.ts\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"src/domain/model/project.test.ts\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"src/domain/rebar/wall.ts\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"src/rulepack/jp-mlit/cover.yaml\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"tests/golden/fixtures/quantity-r5-ch3.json\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"tests/golden/fixtures/spec-r7-ch5.json\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"tests/golden/quantity-measurement.test.ts\\\"\\r\\n  ],\\r\\n  \\\"gates\\\": {\\r\\n    \\\"npm run test\\\": \\\"passed — 83 files, 1518 tests\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"npx tsc --noEmit\\\": \\\"passed\\\",\\r\\n    \\\"npm run lint\\\": \\\"passed — 0 errors, 1 warning (route.test.ts unused variable)\\\"\\r\\n  },\\r\\n  \\\"summary\\\": \\\"WallSection.wallClass optional区分、雑壁のcoverルール、耐力壁限定の継手下限分岐を実装し、同一条件の耐力壁／耐力壁以外ゴールデン対を追加した。\\\"\\r\\n}\\r\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"status\":\"completed\"}}\nphases/24-wall-class\\step2-codex.stdout.log:13:{\"type\":\"item.started\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_7\",\"type\":\"command_execution\",\"command\":\"\\\"C:\\\\\\\\WINDOWS\\\\\\\\System32\\\\\\\\WindowsPowerShell\\\\\\\\v1.0\\\\\\\\powershell.exe\\\" -Command \\\"[Console]::OutputEncoding = [System.Text.Encoding]::UTF8; Write-Output '--- SectionTable 900-1100 ---'; Get-Content -Encoding utf8 src/components/section/SectionTable.tsx | Select-Object -Skip 895 -First 210; Write-Output '--- SectionImport 120-250 ---'; Get-Content -Encoding utf8 src/components/section/SectionImport.tsx | Select-Object -Skip 118 -First 135; Write-Output '--- SectionImport 820-1040 ---'; Get-Content -Encoding utf8 src/components/section/SectionImport.tsx | Select-Object -Skip 820 -First 225; Write-Output '--- SectionTable tests first 260 ---'; Get-Content -Encoding utf8 src/components/sect